WEBVTT

00:01:29.571 --> 00:01:32.841
The trick here is to keep MoldeVort 
where you want him.

00:01:32.841 --> 00:01:35.481
And one way to figure out how to do that

00:01:35.481 --> 00:01:38.751
is to play out the game 
as MoldeVort would:

00:01:38.751 --> 00:01:41.206
always trying to escape.

00:01:41.206 --> 00:01:43.711
You’re dealing with a relatively 
small board,

00:01:43.711 --> 00:01:45.951
so the numbers can’t be too big.

00:01:45.951 --> 00:01:51.350
Let’s start by trying 1, 2, 3, 4 
to see what happens.

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:54.850
Moldevort could escape those numbers
in just three moves.

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:57.140
By saying 2, then 3,

00:01:57.140 --> 00:02:00.970
he would force you to let him into one
of the middle points of the grid,